          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_02",
      "hash64": "C22C79A9C2478733",
      "text": "Oye, tía, menudo[VAR 0x1101(00FD,0100)]s Pokémon te gastas, ¿en?",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FD",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_03",
      "hash64": "C22C78A9C2478580",
      "text": "Yo creo que podrías ventilarte a los Ogros\\nOminosos sin problema.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_select_01",
      "hash64": "F6C6711E164DEA1A",
      "text": "¿Los Ogros Ominosos?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_select_02",
      "hash64": "F6C6701E164DE867",
      "text": "¿Quiénes son esos?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_04",
      "hash64": "C22C7FA9C2479165",
      "text": "Son unos Entrenadores flamísima con máscaras\\ndel ogro que rondan por las afueras de la villa.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_05",
      "hash64": "C22C7EA9C2478FB2",
      "text": "Siempre buscan a peña mazo fuerte como tú\\ncontra la que echar un combate to épico.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_06",
      "hash64": "C22C7DA9C2478DFF",
      "text": "Se rumorea que el grupo tiene siete miembros...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_07",
      "hash64": "C22C7CA9C2478C4C",
      "text": "Si te tienta el tema, que sepas que son unos\\nmonstruos. Eso lo primero.\\c\\nPero, si les ganas, te daré algo mu guapo por\\ncada uno que derrotes.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_08",
      "hash64": "C22C83A9C2479831",
      "text": "¡Eh, cabeza! Que me he enterado de que te\\nhas ventilado a uno de los Ogros Ominosos.\\c\\nAquí tienes la recompensa tan guapa que te\\nhabía prometido. ¡Eres un pasote!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_09",
      "hash64": "C22C82A9C247967E",
      "text": "¡Eh, cabeza! Que me he enterado de que te\\nhas ventilado a varios de los Ogros Ominosos.\\c\\nAquí tienes las recompensas tan guapas que te\\nhabía prometido. ¡Eres un pasote!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_10",
      "hash64": "C22975A9C2454A90",
      "text": "¡Te queda uno más! Te puedo dar una pistica\\nde dónde encontrarlo. ¿Qué me dices?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_11",
      "hash64": "C22976A9C2454C43",
      "text": "¡Te quedan [VAR 0x0200(0001)]! Puedo darte alguna pistica de\\ndónde encontrar al siguiente. ¿Qué me dices?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_01",
      "hash64": "36833974D91DF465",
      "text": "\"Sigue el camino más azul que desciende desde\\nel Monte Ogro y entre el bambú me hallarás\".",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_02",
      "hash64": "36833674D91DEF4C",
      "text": "\"Desde el punto donde me hallo, puedo ver\\nel lugar donde yace el cuerno del ogro\".",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_03",
      "hash64": "36833774D91DF0FF",
      "text": "\"Me escondo en un recoveco próximo al agua\\nque fluye de las fauces del ogro\".",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_04",
      "hash64": "36833474D91DEBE6",
      "text": "\"Me encuentro a orillas de un estanque a medio\\ncamino entre el elíseo y el averno\".",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_05",
      "hash64": "36833574D91DED99",
      "text": "\"Me escondo en un lugar carente de sufrimiento,\\nenvuelto en un extraño paraje baldío y rocoso\".",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_06",
      "hash64": "36833274D91DE880",
      "text": "\"Aguardo a mi contrincante en el más corto\\nde los cuernos del ogro\".",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_hint_07",
      "hash64": "36833374D91DEA33",
      "text": "\"Déjate caer por un recoveco junto al lago\\ndonde la oscuridad no se cierne y me hallarás\".",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_12",
      "hash64": "C22977A9C2454DF6",
      "text": "Y con esto... has conseguido derrotar hasta\\nel último Ogro Ominoso.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_13",
      "hash64": "C22978A9C2454FA9",
      "text": "Has demostrado tu fuerza. Es hora de que te\\nmuestre yo la mía.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_14",
      "hash64": "C22979A9C245515C",
      "text": "¡¡Ja!!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_15",
      "hash64": "C2297AA9C245530F",
      "text": "Ante vos tenéis al único miembro secreto\\ndel clan de los Ogros Ominosos...",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_16",
      "hash64": "C2297BA9C24554C2",
      "text": "Esta será la última contienda que debáis librar.\\nAvisadme cuando estéis list[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para el combate.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_17",
      "hash64": "C2297CA9C2455675",
      "text": "¿Estáis preparad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para enfrentaros a mí?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_18",
      "hash64": "C2297DA9C2455828",
      "text": "Volved cuando lo estéis.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_30",
      "hash64": "C23001A9C24AA422",
      "text": "Busquemos un lugar idóneo para nuestra liza.\\nSeguidme.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_19",
      "hash64": "C2297EA9C24559DB",
      "text": "Ante vos se halla Muramasa, miembro secreto\\ndel clan de los Ogros Ominosos. ¡En guardia!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_20",
      "hash64": "C23387A9C24DBDAB",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja, ja! Loable hazaña. ¡Incluso habéis logrado\\nderrotar a un servidor! No tengo más que elogios\\r\\npara hablar de vuestra fuerza.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_21",
      "hash64": "C23386A9C24DBBF8",
      "text": "...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_22",
      "hash64": "C23389A9C24DC111",
      "text": "¡No te rayes, tí[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! ¡Que es puro teatro!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_23",
      "hash64": "C23388A9C24DBF5E",
      "text": "El juego de los Ogros Ominosos es una actividad\\nque permite a los chiquillos entrenar mientras se\\r\\nlo pasan genial combatiendo.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_24",
      "hash64": "C2338BA9C24DC477",
      "text": "Lo hacemos todos los años durante el Festival\\nde Máscaras, pero...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_25",
      "hash64": "C2338AA9C24DC2C4",
      "text": "¡Los ogros nos metemos tan a hierro en el papel\\nque nunca queda ni un crío en pie!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_26",
      "hash64": "C2338DA9C24DC7DD",
      "text": "Creo que eres [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]ella primer[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a participante que logra\\nvencernos a todos.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_27",
      "hash64": "C2338CA9C24DC62A",
      "text": "En fin, ¡enhorabuena, tí[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa! Lo prometido\\nes deuda. Aquí tienes tu premio.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_28",
      "hash64": "C2337FA9C24DB013",
      "text": "Hala, ¡patéate la naturaleza de Noroteo y sigue\\nhaciéndote más grande y fuerte!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "s1_sub_017_man_29",
      "hash64": "C2337EA9C24DAE60",
      "text": "¡Dichosos los ojos! ¡Si es [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]ella rapaz[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a más tenaz de\\nNoroteo! ¿Acaso venís a departir conmigo?\\c\\n¡Ja, ja, ja! No sabéis cómo me congratula.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
